 if rr['id']=='physics-chapter-27-problems-43':rr['reasoning']='A dynamic enumeration of every series/parallel equivalent through9 identical resistors confirms no network of fewer than9 withReq=R can dissipate5 times one resistor rating. The3-by-3 construction dissipates9W. Verification: normalized worst-resistor powers at1V forcounts4,6,7,8,9 are1/4,4/9,1/4,9/25,1/9.'
